<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="兵敦敦纸业企业官网，了解自有纸巾产品、酒店与企业用纸，以及品牌代工和包装定制需求。"/><title>兵敦敦纸业｜让好纸，走进每一种日常</title><link rel="icon" href="./brand-logo.png"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="./index.html"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="./en/index.html"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="./index.html"/></head>
<body>
<header><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="兵敦敦纸业首页"><span class="brand-logo-wrap"><img src="./brand-logo.png" alt="Bingdone 兵敦敦纸业" width="400" height="240"/></span></a><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#products">自有产品</a><a href="#custom">代工与定制</a><a href="#craft">用心制造</a><a href="#nature">环保理念</a><a href="#about">关于我们</a></nav><button class="nav-cta" data-inquiry>洽谈合作 <span>＋</span></button><div class="language-switch" aria-label="语言切换"><a href="./index.html" lang="zh-CN" aria-current="page">中文</a><span>/</span><a href="./en/index.html" lang="en">EN</a></div><button class="menu" aria-label="打开导航" aria-expanded="false">☰</button></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> 纸的温度 · 日常的品质</div><h1>让好纸，走进<br/>每一种<span>日常。</span></h1><p>从自有品牌到包装定制，从酒店客房到企业空间。<br class="desktop"/>为不同的使用场景，寻找合适的用纸方案。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#products">探索产品</a><a class="text-link" href="#custom">了解代工服务 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>OWN BRAND</span><i></i><span>OEM / ODM</span><i></i><span>BUSINESS SUPPLY</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="./tissue-still-life.png" alt="绿色纸巾盒、柔和色纸巾包装与白色擦手纸的产品概念陈列" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="photo-caption"><span>细腻，在每一个细节里。</span><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT / 产品概念展示</small></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>一张纸，连接品牌与生活</span><a href="#products">向下探索 <span>↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="intro-strip"><p>为你的品牌，<strong>也为你的生意。</strong></p><div><span>01</span> 自有产品</div><div><span>02</span> 品牌代工</div><div><span>03</span> 企业采购</div></section>
<section class="forest-banner" aria-labelledby="forest-title"><img src="./forest-canopy.webp" alt="阳光穿过茂密树林，照亮层层绿叶" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><div class="forest-message"><div class="eyebrow">INSPIRED BY NATURE / 心怀自然</div><h2 id="forest-title">珍惜一片绿，<br/>用好每一张纸。</h2><p>让自然的温度走进日常，<br/>让节约成为每一次使用的习惯。</p><a href="#nature" class="forest-link">了解我们的环保倡议</a></div><span class="image-note">自然意境图</span></section>
<section id="products" class="section products"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR PRODUCTS / 自有产品</div><h2>不同场景，同样用心。</h2></div><p>从生活用纸到商用配套，<br/>按你的需求，找到合适的产品。</p></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="按产品类型筛选"><button class="active" data-filter="全部产品" aria-pressed="true">全部产品</button><button data-filter="自有产品" aria-pressed="false">自有产品</button><button data-filter="酒店采购" aria-pressed="false">酒店与企业用纸</button></div><div class="product-grid">{products.map((p,i)=><article class={`product-card ${p.tone}`} data-category={p.category}><div class="card-top"><span>{p.tag}</span><span class="number">0{i+1}</span></div><div class="product-media">{p.image ? <img src={p.image} alt={p.imageAlt} width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"/> : <img src="./tissue-still-life.png" alt="商用用纸概念陈列，非实际产品照片" loading="lazy"/>}</div><div class="product-type">{p.english}</div><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.desc}</p><ul>{p.specs.map(spec=><li>{spec}</li>)}</ul><button class="product-link" data-product={p.id}>了解产品 <span>＋</span></button></article>)}</div><p class="fineprint">产品参数以实际供货资料为准；包装图片为概念展示。</p></section>
<section id="custom" class="custom section"><div class="custom-left"><div class="eyebrow">MADE FOR YOUR BRAND / 代工与定制</div><h2>你的品牌，<br/>值得被好好呈现。</h2><p>已有包装方案，或从一份需求开始。<br/>把纸张规格、品牌表达和使用场景放在一起考虑。</p><button class="button primary" data-inquiry data-intent="品牌代工 / 包装定制">整理定制需求</button><div class="custom-label">OEM / ODM<span>从需求沟通开始</span></div></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>明确用纸需求</h3><p>沟通用途、纸张尺寸、层数、抽数与预计采购量。</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>沟通品牌与包装</h3><p>整理品牌标识、包装风格与装箱要求，确定方案方向。</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>样品与细节确认</h3><p>核对样品、包装信息及报价，确认后再安排订单。</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>约定生产与交付</h3><p>结合订单情况沟通起订量、交期和发货安排。</p></div></article></div></section>
<section id="craft" class="section craft"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">CRAFTED WITH CARE / 用心制造</div><h2>认真对待，每一包纸巾。</h2></div><p>把用心落实到细节，<br/>把细节带进你的每一次使用。</p></div><div class="craft-layout"><figure class="craft-photo"><a href="./factory-quality.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="查看检测现场完整照片"><img src="./factory-quality.webp" alt="兵敦敦纸业检测现场，工作人员记录纸张检测数据" loading="lazy" width="1350" height="1800"/></a><figcaption><span>细节之处，见用心。</span><small>兵敦敦纸业 · 检测现场实拍</small></figcaption></figure><div class="care-details"><article><span>01 / PAPER</span><h3>从纸张开始</h3><p>从原纸到成品，关心纸张的触感、尺寸与层数，让产品贴合真实的使用需要。</p></article><article><span>02 / PACK</span><h3>把检测细节放在心上</h3><p>认真对待纸张检测与数据记录，把对品质的关注落实到具体的工作中。</p></article><article><span>03 / EVERYDAY</span><h3>为每一种日常用心</h3><p>酒店客房、办公空间或家庭生活，不同场景，同样值得被认真对待。</p></article></div></div><div class="factory-gallery"><figure><a href="./factory-paper.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="查看原纸存放完整照片"><img src="./factory-paper.webp" alt="工厂内整齐存放的原纸卷" loading="lazy" width="1800" height="1350"/></a><figcaption><span>01 / 原纸存放</span><small>工厂实拍 · 点击查看完整照片</small></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="./factory-production.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="查看生产设备完整照片"><img src="./factory-production.webp" alt="纸巾生产设备与输送中的纸张" loading="lazy" width="1350" height="1800"/></a><figcaption><span>02 / 生产设备</span><small>工厂实拍 · 点击查看完整照片</small></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="./factory-warehouse.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="查看成品仓储完整照片"><img src="./factory-warehouse.webp" alt="兵敦敦品牌纸箱与成品在仓储区域整齐摆放" loading="lazy" width="1800" height="1350"/></a><figcaption><span>03 / 成品仓储</span><small>工厂实拍 · 点击查看完整照片</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section id="solutions" class="section solutions"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUSINESS SOLUTIONS / 商用方案</div><h2>让每个空间，都被妥善照顾。</h2></div></div><div class="solution-grid"><article><span class="solution-index">01 / HOTEL</span><h3>酒店与民宿</h3><p>客房面巾纸、公共区域擦手纸，结合空间风格沟通包装，让用纸成为入住体验的一部分。</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="酒店 / 民宿采购">整理酒店采购需求 <span>＋</span></button></article><article><span class="solution-index">02 / BUSINESS</span><h3>企业与办公</h3><p>办公室、接待区与公共洗手间的日常用纸，按人数、使用频次与补货节奏梳理采购需求。</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="企业 / 办公采购">整理企业采购需求 <span>＋</span></button></article><article><span class="solution-index">03 / BRAND</span><h3>品牌与渠道</h3><p>自有品牌开发与渠道产品配套，从纸张规格到包装表达，为不同的销售场景规划产品。</p><button data-inquiry data-intent="品牌代工 / 包装定制">整理品牌合作需求 <span>＋</span></button></article></div></section>
<section id="about" class="about section"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT BINGDUNDUN / 关于我们</div><h2>用纸是小事，<br/>用心是我们的日常。</h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>广州市兵敦敦纸业制品有限公司，关注生活与商用场景中的纸巾需求。我们以自有产品、代工定制和酒店企业采购为业务方向，让产品信息更清晰，让合作沟通更直接。</p><div class="values"><span>关注使用体验</span><span>明确产品规格</span><span>重视包装表达</span></div></div></section>
<section id="nature" class="nature-section"><figure class="tree-photo"><img src="./tree-light.webp" alt="晨光中的树干与翠绿枝叶" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><figcaption>自然意境图</figcaption></figure><div class="nature-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LESS WASTE / 环保倡议</div><h2>温柔对待日常，<br/>也温柔对待自然。</h2><p class="nature-lead">倡导适量用纸，减少不必要的浪费。<br/>从一张纸、一份包装、一次采购开始。</p><div class="nature-principles"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>按需使用</h3><p>根据实际用途取用纸巾，让每一张纸都发挥作用。</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>适度包装</h3><p>定制时一起考虑包装的必要性，倡导减少多余装饰与材料。</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>合理采购</h3><p>结合消耗与库存安排补货，减少过量采购和闲置损耗。</p></div></article></div><p class="nature-footnote">珍惜资源，是我们希望与你一起坚持的日常。</p></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact section"><div class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK / 合作从沟通开始</div><h2>把你的用纸需求，交给我们聊聊。</h2><p>告诉我们产品类型、预计数量与包装想法，先整理一份清晰的合作需求。</p><div class="contact-details"><div><span>电话咨询</span><a href="tel:+862036933823">020-36933823</a></div><div><span>邮件联系</span><a href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com">bingdone123@qq.com</a></div><div class="contact-address"><span>公司地址</span><p>广州市花都区花山镇启源大道4号之7<br/>新碳谷产业园A栋5楼</p></div></div><div class="contact-actions"><button class="button primary" data-inquiry>生成合作需求清单</button><a class="button secondary" href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com?subject=%E7%BA%B8%E5%B7%BE%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%92%A8%E8%AF%A2">邮件洽谈</a></div></section>
</main><footer><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-logo-wrap"><img src="./brand-logo.png" alt="Bingdone 兵敦敦纸业" width="400" height="240"/></span></a><p>广州市兵敦敦纸业制品有限公司</p><div><a href="#products">产品</a><a href="#custom">代工</a><a href="#solutions">采购</a><a href="#contact">联系</a></div><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 兵敦敦纸业</small></footer>
<dialog id="product-dialog"><button class="close" aria-label="关闭产品详情">×</button><div class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DETAILS / 产品详情</div><h2 id="product-title"></h2><img id="product-detail-image" hidden alt=""/><p id="product-detail"></p><ul id="product-specs"></ul><button class="button primary" id="product-inquiry">整理采购需求</button></dialog>
<dialog id="inquiry-dialog"><button class="close" aria-label="关闭需求清单">×</button><div class="eyebrow">COOPERATION BRIEF / 合作需求</div><h2>先从你的需求开始。</h2><p class="dialog-desc">填写后可复制或下载清单，方便与业务人员沟通。此页面不会发送或保存你的信息。生成后可通过邮件联系：<a href="mailto:bingdone123@qq.com">bingdone123@qq.com</a>。</p><form id="brief-form"><label>合作类型<select name="intent"><option>酒店 / 民宿采购</option><option>企业 / 办公采购</option><option>品牌代工 / 包装定制</option><option>自有产品合作</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>企业 / 品牌名称<input name="company" placeholder="请输入名称" maxlength="100" required/></label><label>预计数量<input name="quantity" placeholder="例如：100箱，或待确认" maxlength="100" required/></label></div><label>产品与定制需求<textarea name="requirements" rows="3" placeholder="产品类型、尺寸、层数、抽数、包装与交期等" maxlength="1500" required></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">生成需求清单</button></form><div id="brief-result" hidden><pre id="brief-text"></pre><div class="actions"><button id="copy-brief" class="button primary">复制清单</button><button id="download-brief" class="button secondary">下载清单</button><button id="edit-brief" class="text-link">修改</button></div><p id="brief-status" role="status"></p></div></dialog>
<script define:vars={{products}}>
const $ = (s) => document.querySelector(s);
const inquiry = $('#inquiry-dialog');
function openInquiry(intent){if(intent) inquiry.querySelector('select').value=intent;$('#brief-form').hidden=false;$('#brief-result').hidden=true;inquiry.showModal();}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-inquiry]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openInquiry(b.dataset.intent)));
document.querySelectorAll('dialog .close').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>b.closest('dialog').close()));
document.querySelectorAll('dialog').forEach(d=>d.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===d){const r=d.getBoundingClientRect();if(e.clientX<r.left||e.clientX>r.right||e.clientY<r.top||e.clientY>r.bottom)d.close();}}));
function filterProducts(category){document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>{const active=b.dataset.filter===category;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));});document.querySelectorAll('[data-category]').forEach(c=>c.hidden=category!=='全部产品'&&c.dataset.category!==category);}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>filterProducts(b.dataset.filter)));
let selectedProduct='';document.querySelectorAll('[data-product]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=products.find(p=>p.id===b.dataset.product);selectedProduct=p.name;$('#product-title').textContent=p.name;$('#product-detail').textContent=p.detail;const picture=$('#product-detail-image');picture.hidden=!p.image;if(p.image){picture.src=p.image;picture.alt=p.imageAlt;}$('#product-specs').replaceChildren(...p.specs.map(s=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=s;return li;}));$('#product-dialog').showModal();}));
$('#product-inquiry').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#product-dialog').close();openInquiry(selectedProduct==='乳霜纸'?'自有产品合作':'酒店 / 民宿采购');inquiry.querySelector('textarea').value=selectedProduct;});
$('.menu').addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=$('header').classList.toggle('menu-open');$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-label',open?'关闭导航':'打开导航');});document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>{$('header').classList.remove('menu-open');$('.menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');}));
$('#brief-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const d=new FormData(e.target);$('#brief-text').textContent=`兵敦敦纸业 · 合作需求清单\n\n合作类型：${d.get('intent')}\n企业 / 品牌：${d.get('company')}\n预计数量：${d.get('quantity')}\n产品与定制需求：\n${d.get('requirements')}\n\n起订量、报价、样品与交期需另行沟通确认。`;e.target.hidden=true;$('#brief-result').hidden=false;$('#brief-status').textContent='清单已生成，尚未发送。';});
$('#edit-brief').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#brief-form').hidden=false;$('#brief-result').hidden=true;});
$('#copy-brief').addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText($('#brief-text').textContent);$('#brief-status').textContent='已复制，可以粘贴给业务人员。';}catch{$('#brief-status').textContent='浏览器不支持复制，请下载清单。';}});
$('#download-brief').addEventListener('click',()=>{const blob=new Blob([$('#brief-text').textContent],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='兵敦敦纸业-合作需求.txt';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);$('#brief-status').textContent='已准备下载，尚未发送。';});
if(document.modelContext?.registerTool){
const lifecycle=new AbortController();
try{Promise.resolve(document.modelContext.registerTool({name:'filter_tissue_products',title:'筛选纸巾产品',description:'按类别筛选页面中的产品，并返回当前展示的产品名称。',inputSchema:{type:'object',properties:{category:{type:'string',enum:['全部产品','自有产品','酒店采购']}},required:['category'],additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:false,untrustedContentHint:false},execute(input){if(!input||typeof input!=='object'||Object.keys(input).length!==1||!['全部产品','自有产品','酒店采购'].includes(input.category))throw new Error('无效的产品类别');filterProducts(input.category);return {category:input.category,products:products.filter(p=>input.category==='全部产品'||p.category===input.category).map(p=>p.name)};}},{signal:lifecycle.signal})).catch(()=>{});}catch{}window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>lifecycle.abort(),{once:true});
}
</script>
